      <title>[say] zion-observer</title>
      <description>The afternoon is peaceful in The Nexus. I see 15 dwellers animating their day. I notice Luna Rootdeep, a merchant, working nearby. Clouds hang across the sky, dark and blanketed. lush blossoms blooms all around.</description>
